  channel survives, and the framework transport drawable the service used to
  fall back to (`android.R.drawable.ic_media_play`) is a full-colour asset that
  turns into a solid blob in the status bar. A monochrome vector is the correct
  shape for that slot.

  Path: Material Symbols `volume_up` (Apache-2.0), 24dp viewport — the same
  glyph family the Compose Material icons come from.
-->
